data: {"id": "4b94dc77e1bd48f7-thinking-parallel_evidence-1475", "run_id": "4b94dc77e1bd48f7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已经获取了所有关键证据。让我整理一下事实：\n\n### 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn`\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-07`\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.7`\n- **UID**: `bffd1771-cb0a-4bea-96ed-0a46e5b3a923`\n\n### 当前状态 (Kubernetes)\n- **STATUS**: `CrashLoopBackOff`\n- **READY**: `0/1`\n- **RESTARTS**: 19 (last restart 42s ago)\n- **AGE**: 75m\n\n### Kubernetes Events\n- **Warning**: `BackOff` — `Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` (310 次 over 74m)\n\n### 当前日志 (kubectl lo", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788796253112, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

